+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* <Note>                                                                */
+  /*    This function is normally equivalent to FT_STREAM_SEEK(offset)     */
+  /*    followed by FT_FRAME_ENTER(byte_count) with the loader's stream,   */
+  /*    but alternative formats (e.g. compressed ones) might use something */
+  /*    different.                                                         */
