+  /*                                                                       */
+  /*  - Fontconfig can't set things on a glyph-by-glyph basis.             */
+  /*  - The tweaks that happen here are very low-level, from an average    */
+  /*    user's point of view and are best implemented in the hinter.       */
+  /*                                                                       */
