+  /* as possible across all fonts to prevent the need for extra rules such */
+  /* as these.                                                             */
+  /*                                                                       */
+  /* The rule structure is designed so that entirely new rules can easily  */
+  /* be added when a new compatibility feature is discovered.              */
+  /*                                                                       */
