+ * When we wish to append attributes to a function prototype we use
+ * the PNG_EXPORTA() macro instead.
+ *
+ *   PNG_EXPORTA(ordinal, type, name, (args), attributes);
+ *
+ *       ordinal, type, name, and args: same as in PNG_EXPORT().
